flowchart TD
    Emblem[Emblem moves after 6px drag threshold] --> OS[Tauri starts native window drag]
    OS --> Release[Wait for actual mouse release on macOS]
    Release --> Area[Read final position and monitor work area]
    Area --> Zones{Within 48pt of an edge?}
    Zones -->|Yes| Anchor[Nearest of four sides and four corners]
    Zones -->|No| Free[Free placement]
    Anchor --> Save[Save dock_edge in local studio.json]
    Free --> Save
    Settings[Appearance placement picker] --> Save
    Save --> Place[Clamp dock inside work area with 12pt inset]
    Hover[Hover or keyboard focus] --> Rail[Attached action rail opens inward]
    Events[Real voice and screen recording state] --> Status[Status island and Stop or saved action]
    Rail --> Resize[Native compact panel changes size]
    Status --> Resize
    Resize --> Place
    Place --> Keep[Preserve emblem position and selected anchor]
